worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_capabilities_and_runtime_rules.js"
  ceiling 659
  rationale "The typed behavior-rule compiler declines before the seeded general procedure compiler is tried, matching the native handler. Only this three-line dispatch bridge was added. All teaching, catalog, history replay and events share the generated skill compiler package; removing the duplicate local constructor lowers this module to 648. Issue #1582 adds a seed-role dispatch bridge for multilingual internet permission help; all vocabulary and response text stay in the seed. Request ownership is anchored to the start of a seeded direct request so quoted task data cannot dispatch permission guidance."
